  description: '"Utopia" and "Utopic" Xyz Monsters you control whose original Attribute
    is LIGHT cannot be destroyed by card effects, also your opponent cannot target
    them with card effects. You can only use each of the following effects of "Gagaga
    Utopic Tactics" once per turn. You can declare a Level from 1 to 12, then target
    2 face-up monsters you control, including a "Gagaga" monster; they become that
    Level. If you Xyz Summon a "Utopia" or "Utopic" Xyz Monster whose original Attribute
    is LIGHT: You can target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy it.'
